{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04030","headline":"奉和圣制人日清晖阁宴羣臣遇雪应制 · 苏頲","name":"奉和圣制人日清晖阁宴羣臣遇雪应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼观空烟里，初年瑞雪过。\n苑花齐玉树，池水作银河。\n七日祥图啓，千春御赏多。\n轻飞传彩胜，天上奉薰歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04030.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04030","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}